{"slug":"/students/subjects/english/comprehension-reading/comprehension-strategies/","source":"students/subjects/english/comprehension-reading/comprehension-strategies.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Comprehension Strategies","description":"","subject":"english","body":"<div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n    <nav class=\"mb-4\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/english/comprehension-reading/\" class=\"text-blue-600\">← Back to Comprehension</a></nav>\n    <article class=\"card p-6 rounded-lg\">\n      <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">Comprehension Strategies</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Skimming for gist, scanning for details, and predicting content.</p>\n\n      <h2 class=\"font-semibold\">Worked example</h2>\n      <p class=\"mb-2\">Find the main idea: short paragraph provided (omitted).</p>\n      <p class=\"mb-4\"><strong>Solution:</strong> Identify topic sentence and supporting details.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Practice</h3>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal pl-5 mb-4 text-gray-700\">\n        <li>Skim a short passage and write one-sentence gist.</li>\n        <li>Scan for dates or names in a passage.</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h4 class=\"font-semibold\">Brief answers</h4>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal pl-5 text-gray-700\">\n        <li>Answers depend on passage; look for topic sentence.</li>\n        <li>Examples will vary; list items found in scan.</li>\n      </ol>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-50 to-orange-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif}.card{ -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}